{"3030190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pandora's Toybox", "steam_appid": 3030190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pandora's Toybox blends the boundless freedom of a sandbox God Game with the deep, replayable strategy of a Roguelite.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE A LIVING PIXEL WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every human in your realm is a unique individual with their own name and traits. You are the ultimate architect: play as a passive observer watching them evolve naturally, or actively intervene. Bestow technological revelations, spawn vital resources, or manipulate the world to guide your people from scattered tribes into sprawling, fortified city-states.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe38bc99bf10fb5772d76b95e2280e5f.poster.avif?t=1785825785\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe38bc99bf10fb5772d76b95e2280e5f.webm?t=1785825785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe38bc99bf10fb5772d76b95e2280e5f.mp4?t=1785825785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRAFT YOUR OLYMPIAN COUNCIL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a roster of 8 legendary deities, including Zeus, Hades, Apollo, and Ares. In every run, you must draft 3 gods to form your divine council. With nearly 200 skill combinations, discovering overpowered synergies is the key to mastering the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/8b2d1ffb31d9de7eb2741b3f0d01dee1.poster.avif?t=1785825785\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/8b2d1ffb31d9de7eb2741b3f0d01dee1.webm?t=1785825785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/8b2d1ffb31d9de7eb2741b3f0d01dee1.mp4?t=1785825785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CULTIVATE FAITH &amp; CRUSH HERETICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faith is your ultimate currency. Perform miracles to inspire your populace and answer their temple prayers to unlock game-changing artifacts that buff your entire civilization. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ee5a1be120a0a92da4c043266cb55e89.poster.avif?t=1785825785\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ee5a1be120a0a92da4c043266cb55e89.webm?t=1785825785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/ee5a1be120a0a92da4c043266cb55e89.mp4?t=1785825785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But growth breeds war. When rival city-states and heretical factions rise to challenge your dominance, how will you respond? Lead your faithful into a bloody Holy War, or simply use your divine wrath to wipe enemy cities off the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/a0e82ea49e88d1176824805431e29b2a.poster.avif?t=1785825785\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/a0e82ea49e88d1176824805431e29b2a.webm?t=1785825785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/a0e82ea49e88d1176824805431e29b2a.mp4?t=1785825785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS ROGUELITE PROGRESSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every attempt to build a civilization offers a completely fresh run. Collect &quot;Faith Crystals&quot; across your playthroughs to unlock permanent meta-upgrades. Expand your pantheon, learn devastating new abilities, and tackle increasingly difficult procedural map challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/f1c1738d1ee944fba8749e06d675eeda.poster.avif?t=1785825785\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/f1c1738d1ee944fba8749e06d675eeda.webm?t=1785825785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/f1c1738d1ee944fba8749e06d675eeda.mp4?t=1785825785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEYOND THE CAMPAIGN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the main progression with two massive expanded modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode:</strong> Enjoy pure creative freedom with all powers and artifacts unlocked. Build your flawless utopia (or torture your creations).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>God-Clash Mode:</strong> Trigger a cross-dimensional brawl in a chaotic, auto-battler-style showdown where major pantheons face off for supremacy.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pandora's Toybox blends the boundless freedom of a sandbox God Game with the deep, replayable strategy of a Roguelite.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE A LIVING PIXEL WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every human in your realm is a unique individual with their own name and traits. You are the ultimate architect: play as a passive observer watching them evolve naturally, or actively intervene. Bestow technological revelations, spawn vital resources, or manipulate the world to guide your people from scattered tribes into sprawling, fortified city-states.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe38bc99bf10fb5772d76b95e2280e5f.poster.avif?t=1785825785\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe38bc99bf10fb5772d76b95e2280e5f.webm?t=1785825785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/fe38bc99bf10fb5772d76b95e2280e5f.mp4?t=1785825785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DRAFT YOUR OLYMPIAN COUNCIL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a roster of 8 legendary deities, including Zeus, Hades, Apollo, and Ares. In every run, you must draft 3 gods to form your divine council. With nearly 200 skill combinations, discovering overpowered synergies is the key to mastering the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/8b2d1ffb31d9de7eb2741b3f0d01dee1.poster.avif?t=1785825785\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030190/extras/8b2d1ffb31d9de7eb2741b3f0d01dee1.webm?t=1785825785\" type=